        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Haruni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivi nivo vivalwa va weke Haruni na Musa, seji verekoghe ingelo BWANA oreghorieghe na Musa aighu ya Mghondi ghwa Sinai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haruni orekoghe na wana bana: wa imbiri ni Nadabu, na waruna ni Abihu, Eleazari, na Ithamari;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.26.60"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit. 26.60",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "awo wereshingiloghe mavuda na kuwikwa wakfu wikaie wakohani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Nadabu na Abihu werefueghe imbiri ya BWANA, iji werefunyireghe modo ghwa kizongona kisha aja kireti cha Sinai. Awo ndewerekoghe na wana wangi; kwa kuwo, Eleazari na Ithamari werekoghe wikibonya kazi ya wukohani matuku ghose ndee uko moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.1+LEV.10.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wal. 10.1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.26.61"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit. 26.61",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuwika Walawi wiwidumikie Wakohani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao BWANA ukamzera Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Reda wandu wa kichuku cha Lawi kaavui na mkohani Haruni, eri wimtesie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wichabonya kazi rake, na ra ijo izungu jose imbiri ya Hema ekwania, ngelo widumikagha andenyi ya andu kwapo kokaia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wichakaia wikivizighana vilambo vose va Hema ekwania, na kuwidumikia wandu wa Israeli ingelo wawuyadumika andenyi ya andu kwapo kokaia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchamneka Haruni na wana wake Walawi wose kufuma kwa Waisraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na oho kuchammbika Haruni na wana wake wikaie wikibonya ugho wukohani ghwawo; ela mndungi mzima ukasoghoda uchabwaghwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao BWANA ukamzera Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ola nameria kuwiwusa Walawi aghadi ya wandu wa Israeli, wulalo ghwa kula mvalwa wa imbiri wa womi wa Israeli. Walawi wichaka wapo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "angu ituku nerebwaghieghe wavalwa wa imbiri wose andenyi ya isanga ja Misri, nedekusaghuya wavalwa wa imbiri wose andenyi ya Israeli, ikaiagha wandu angu nyamandu; Ini ne BWANA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 13.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kutala Walawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao BWANA ukamzera Musa aho kireti cha Sinai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tala Walawi nyumba kwa nyumba kula mundu wa womi wa irika ja mori ghumweri na kuchumba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Musa ukawitala sa iji koni BWANA oremlaghirieghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na agho nigho marina gha wana wa Lawi: Gershoni, Kohathi, na Merari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marina gha wana wa Gershoni, kunughana na nyumba rawo ni: Libni na Shimei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wana wa Kohathi kunughana na nyumba rawo ni: Amramu, Ishari, Hebroni, na Uzieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wana wa Merari kunughana na nyumba rawo ni: Mahli na Mushi. Ivi nivo vinyumba va Lawi kunughana na vichuku vawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wagershoni niwo wichewuya Walibni na Washimei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtalo ghose ghwa wandu wa womi seji weretaliloghe kufuma wa irika ja mori ghumweri, na kuchumba, ghorekoghe elfu mfungade, na maghana masanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyumba ra Wagershoni wedeeka wibonyere kambi nyuma ya Hema iichia cha magharibi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliasafu mwana wa Laeli nuo orekoghe kilongozi chawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kazi ya wana wa Gershoni werenekeloghe andenyi ya Hema ekwania edeeka kuzighana nandenyi yaro, na cha shighadi yaro, na pazia ya mnyango ghwaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wurigha ghwa nguwo ghwa wazenyi, pazia ya mnyango ghwa wazenyi, iyo iko mbai mbai ya Hema na madhabahu, na pazia ya mnyango, na wudumiki ghose ghwa ivo vilambo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kivalwa cha Kohathi niwo weni wicheewuya Waaramu, na Waishari, na Wahebroni, na Wauzieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtalo ghwa wandu wose wa womi kufuma wa irika ja mori ghumweri na kuchumba ghorekoghe elfu wunyanya na maghana arandadu, wiandikilo wedumika andenyi ya Andu kwa Wueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyumba ra wana wa Kohathi wedeeka wibonyeghee kambi iichia cha kusinyi ya Hema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliasafu mwana wa Uzieli nuo orekoghe kilongozi chawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kazi yawo edeeka kuzighana iyo Sanduku ya Ilaghano, meza, kinara cha taa, madhabahu, vilambo va Andu kwa Wueli kuchumbie, na wudumiki ghose ghwa ivo vilambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eleazari mwana wa mkohani Haruni nuo orekoghe m'baa wa vilongozi va Walawi, na kuwizighana awo werekoghe wazighaniri wa Andu kwa Wueli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kivalwa cha Merari niwo weni wicheewuya Wamahli na Wamushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wose wa womi kunughana na mtalo ghwawo, kufuma wa irika ja mori ghumweri na kuchumba ghorekoghe elfu irandadu na maghana awi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sureili mwana wa Abihaili, nuo orekoghe kilongozi chawo; nawo werekoghe wikipanga ii chia cha kaskazinyi ya Hema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Merari werenekeloghe kazi ezighana fremu ra Hema, mbau, nguro, vishawalata va nandonyi, na vilambo vizima vewadanishwa navo. Werenekeloghe wudumiki ghose ghwa ivo vilambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wokoni werenekeloghe kazi ezighana nguro ra waza iyo erekoghe mbai mbai, vishawalata varo va nandonyi vigingi varo na kamba raro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
