            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa, Haruni na wana wake, wedeeka wibonyeghee kambi naimbiri ya Hema iichia cha mashariki. Awo werekoghe na kazi ezighana mizango ya wutasi andenyi ya Andu kwa Wueli, kwa wundu ghwa wandu wa Israeli; mndungi mzima ukatima kubonya ugho wudumiki wadabwaghwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kichuku cha Lawi chose cheretaliloghe kunughana na nyumba rawo, seji Musa na Haruni werewitalieghe kwa kulaghirwa ni BWANA, wandu wose wa womi kufuma wa irika ja mori ghumweri, na kuchumba werekoghe elfu mirongo iwi na iwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kichuku cha Lawi kuwusa wulalo ghwa wavalwa wa imbiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao BWANA ukamzera Musa, “Tala wavalwa wa imbiri wa womi wose wa wandu wa Israeli, kufuma wa irika ja mori ghumweri na kuchumba, nao kuandike marina ghawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na oho kuchawiwika wavalwa wa imbiri wa Walawi wikaie wapo; ini ne BWANA. Wichakaia wulalo ghwa wavalwa wa imbiri wose wiko aghadi ya wandu wa Israeli; na wokoni mfugho rawo richakaia wulalo ghwa wavalwa wa imbiri wa mfugho rose ra wandu wa Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Musa ukawitala wavalwa wa imbiri wose wa wandu wa Israeli, sa iji koni orelaghiriloghe ni BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wavalwa wa imbiri wose weretaliloghe na kuandikwa marina kufuma wa irika ja mori ghumweri, na kuchumba, werekoghe elfu mirongo iwi na iwi maghana awi na mirongo mfungade na wadadu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
